- reuse the existing Microsoft Auth V2 login/recovery flow inside the UID Email profile;
- run Authorization Code + PKCE as a public client, no client secret;
- capture the localhost callback before Chromium shows `ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED`;
- exchange the code in Electron Main and store only the encrypted refresh token in canonical Email state;
- keep existing Graph Mail.Read refresh-token path unchanged;
- block other Email browser actions while an OAuth profile flow is active;
- add the dedicated OAuth utility worker to the Electron build and focused PKCE/callback tests.

